  data: {
    LLM: '1. Attacking: One player leads a card (the attack).\n2. Defending: The defender must play a higher card of the same suit or a trump.\n3. Beating cards: If a defender beats all attacking cards, the cards are discarded (Vejbit).\n4. Failure: If a defender cannot beat a card, they must pick up common pile.',
    Player: '1. Attacking: One player leads a card (the attack).\n2. Defending: The defender must play a higher card of the same suit or a trump.\n3. Beating cards: If a defender beats all attacking cards, the cards are discarded (Vejbit).\n4. Failure: If a defender cannot beat a card, they must pick up common pile.',
